  "details": "1. make an avatar that uses a lot of audio clips that are referenced in a \"VRC Animator Play Audio\" Script\n\n2. attempt to build the avatar for android\n\n3. you can get an error for exceeding the max build size for an avatar (10mb).\n\nThis should be considered a bug, because quest avatars cannot have audio clips. this means that these files cannot be referenced on a quest avatar, and should not be taken into account for file size calculation. \n\nthe reason why this is a problem is that building an avatar that utilizes this feature means you have to make another animator controller that has all of those scripts disabled or it will factor into the file size.",
